flowchart Release Gate
// stress: long-labels — edge labels of 20 to 40 characters between close nodes, left to right
direction-lr
(Start) -> <Tests pass?>
<Tests pass?> -every suite is green on main-> <Review done?>
<Tests pass?> -a flaky suite failed twice in a row-> [Quarantine]
[Quarantine] -owner fixed the flaky test-> <Tests pass?>
<Review done?> -two approvals and no open threads-> [Ship]
<Review done?> -changes requested by a reviewer-> [Rework]
[Rework] -author pushed a new revision-> <Review done?>
[Ship] -> (Done)
